The crossover point at which EC-HTE achieves lower RMSE than global correction is $n_{\text{expert}} = 250$ for $K{=}2$/extreme and $n_{\text{expert}} = 1000$ for $K{=}4$/extreme (Figure~\ref{fig:budget}).
